  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>)</mo></math> bond<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>360</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>)</mo></math> bond<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.<br /><br />In <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>620</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></msub></math>&nbsp;bond<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>620</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></msub></math>&nbsp;bond<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mrow><mn>96</mn><mo>.48</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.83</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>eV</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>bond</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8491;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math> for rupture of</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>hc</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac></math><br />The wave length required to break&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;bond<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12408</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.83</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>14950</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8491;</mi></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"h